<title>USA: Continental Airlines has summer fare sale.</title>
<headline>Continental Airlines has summer fare sale.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines Inc said Tuesday that it is offering a sale on summer travel throughout the United States.</p>
<p>The company said sale fares require a seven-day advance purchase and apply to travel for the period ending October 8.</p>
<p>It said tickets must be bought by May 20.</p>
